\newlabel{tab:sea23}{{2}{9}{Results on Sea Animals 23 (23 classes, 13{,}711 images). The ConvNeXt-Tiny row is reported by Daga et al.~\cite {daga2026aquaselect}, who reserve 15\% of the training split for validation (9{,}322/1{,}646/2{,}743). Our 80/20 stratified split yields a test set of comparable size but is not the identical partition}{table.caption.4}{}}
